{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05551","headline":"折杨柳 · 徐延寿","name":"折杨柳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大道连国门，东西种杨柳。\n葳蕤君不见，嫋娜垂来久。\n缘枝栖暝禽，雄去雌独吟。\n余花怨春尽，微月起秋阴。\n坐望窗中蝶，起攀枝上叶。\n好风吹长条，婀娜何如妾。\n妾见柳园新，高楼四五春。\n莫吹胡塞曲，愁杀陇头人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05551.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05551","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}